{"name":"Pelican","hex":"#c1bcac","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Pelican","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A place in Australia:\nA suburb of Newcastle, New South Wales.\nA rural locality in Western Downs Region, Queensland.","A suburb of Newcastle, New South Wales."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Pelican"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pelican","blocks":[{"text":"Pelicans are a genus of large water birds that make up the family Pelecanidae. They are characterized by a long beak and a large throat pouch used for catching prey and draining water from the scooped-up contents before swallowing. They have predominantly pale plumage, except for the brown and Peruvian pelicans. The bills, pouches, and bare facial skin of all pelicans become brightly coloured before the breeding season."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Pelikan_Walvis_Bay.jpg/330px-Pelikan_Walvis_Bay.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pelican","wikidata":"Q19413"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Pelicans_at_National_Zoo.jpg/500px-Pelicans_at_National_Zoo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Pelicans_at_National_Zoo.jpg/1280px-Pelicans_at_National_Zoo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/Pelicans_at_National_Zoo.jpg/500px-Pelicans_at_National_Zoo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pelicans at National Zoo, Bangladesh","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APelicans_at_National_Zoo.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/74/Hammerkopf2.jpg/500px-Hammerkopf2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_conte